# ── Large binaries kept out of GitHub ─────────────────────────────────────
# Trained revORC / HP surrogate bundles (~2.4 GB; the largest file is 2 GB).
# The wrapper code and README stay in the repo; obtain the bundles separately
# (see README "Large files").
revers_surrogates/models/*.joblib

# Solved scenarios (workbooks, CSVs, plots, Gurobi incumbents)
results/*
!results/.gitkeep

# Cached revORC hourly maps (rebuilt on first run)
data/revorc_maps_cache/

